 seconds.","If Taliyah is casting an ability or enters champion combat, Rock Surfing cannot occur again for a few seconds."]}]},{"slot":"Q","variants":[{"name":"Threaded Volley","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[56,74.5,93,111.5,130],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[50,50,50,50,50],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Reduced Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[22.4,29.8,37.2,44.6,52],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[20,20,20,20,20],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Total Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[145.6,193.7,241.8,289.9,338],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[130,130,130,130,130],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Empowered Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[100.8,134.1,167.4,200.7,234],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[90,90,90,90,90],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Slow","modifiers":[{"values":[20,25,30,35,40],"units":["%","%","%","%","%"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Taliyah can move and cast other abilities while launching Stone Shards, and is unable to basic attack until she launches the third Stone Shard.","Casting Threaded Volley creates an area of Worked Ground at Taliyah's cast location that has a radius of 400 units and lasts 30 seconds. While on Worked Ground, Threaded Volley's cast consumes the area to become empowered with a new effect, costing 20 mana and having 50% reduced cooldown, though not below 0.75 seconds.","Against monsters, Threaded Volley deals 10 bonus magic damage per Stone Shard, and the Boulder deals 18 bonus magic damage against the primary target. This bonus damage is unaffected by the damage modifier from subsequent hits."]}]},{"slot":"W","variants":[{"name":"Seismic Shove","rows":[],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Active: Taliyah marks the target location and selects a direction. After 0.792 seconds, a ledge erupts from the area that knocks enemies hit 400 units in the target direction over 1 second."]}]},{"slot":"E","variants":[{"name":"Unraveled Earth","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[60,105,150,195,240],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[60,60,60,60,60],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Detonation Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[25,45,65,85,105],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[30,30,30,30,30],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Total Maximum Detonation Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[62.5,112.5,162.5,212.5,262.5],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[75,75,75,75,75],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Unraveled Earth deals 175% damage against monsters."]}]},{"slot":"R","variants":[{"name":"Weaver's Wall","rows":[],"damageType":null,"effects":["Active: Taliyah summons a torrent of spiraling rocks that cascades in the target direction, knocking aside champions hit and erecting a wall of terrain in its wake. The wall lasts for 4 seconds after completion, then slowly disintegrates from its starting point.","Taliyah also channels for 1 second, during which Weaver's Wall can be recast and she reveals herself.","Recast: Upon completing the channel, Taliyah surfs on the wall as it emerges, revealing herself in the process. After 0.75 seconds, she may input a movement command to jump off the wall to the target location, and automatically does so upon being immobilized or silenced or reaching maximum range.Once the wall has fully formed, Taliyah can recast to destroy the wall instantly.","Weaver's Wall is placed on a 3-second static cooldown upon taking champion or turret damage."]}]}],"formulaVersion":"15.15.1","history":[{"patch":"26.21","date":"2026-10-20","articleDate":"2026-10-20","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/league-of-legends-patch-26-21-notes/#patch-taliyah","changes":[{"slot":"E","title":"E - 대지의 파동","text":"피해량 : 60/105/150/195/240 (+주문력의 60